mes_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Noxious Fumes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Noxious_Fumes_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Fumes_(Condition)\" title=\"Noxious Fumes (Condition)\">Noxious Fumes</a></li>\n<li>Grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/25px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/38px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/50px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp/25px-Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/67/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Melf%27s_Acid_Arrow\" title=\"Melf's Acid Arrow\">Melf's Acid Arrow</a> (as level 2 spell)</li>\n<li>Grants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hunger_of_Hadar\" title=\"Hunger of Hadar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp/25px-Hunger_of_Hadar_Icon.webp, /